WEBVTT

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.770
The Continental Congress.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:09.530
Held every five years among the leaders of five nations,

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:14.560
this most critical conference determines
the future of the entire Arc Strada continent.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:20.040
This time, Lautreamont Knight Country was chosen to host.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:24.460
Why would Eco and I be summoned to such an important event?

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.950
And this city we're going to, this Fon...

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.990
Fontaine?

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.690
Yeah, that. What kind of place is it?

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.690
The capital of Lautreamont Knight Country.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.830
Cappy-tall?

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.300
It's so big that Ansullivan looks like a village in comparison.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.480
So they might have crepes
I haven't tried yet!

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.000
Maybe.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.310
There it is.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.160
That's it?!

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:47.810
Yes.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.660
Our nation's capital, Fontaine.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:57.390
In between the Zepharos Kingdom

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.590
and the Chevron Kingdom to the south

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:02.510
lies Lautreamont Knight Country.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.710
Known as "Dragon-Rearing Land,"

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.120
it boasts the largest dragon population on the Arc Strada continent.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.700
This small country with fewer than five million citizens

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.630
is home to a unique school:

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.610
Ansullivan Dragonar Academy.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.110
It aims to educate and guide dragon masters

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.240
and the so-called Breeders,
those young men and women

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:25.850
who have entered into bonds with dragons.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:09.040
Welcome home, Princess Silvia.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:14.250
I know you've just arrived,
but the Paladin awaits.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.670
I'll show my guests around first.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:17.750
That won't do.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.990
First you must greet the Paladin.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.510
Sorry about this.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.370
If there's anything you need,
just ask Frieda here.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.440
Princess?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.520
Yeah. Let's get this over with.

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.370
Please follow me.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:54.790
Security's pretty tight.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:56.960
The host country must be careful,

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:01.310
taking every possible step to
ensure the visiting leaders' safety

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:04.610
and providing them with hospitality during their stay. It's only natural.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:05.300
Yes, of course.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:11.060
You understand we have little time to entertain people like you.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.360
Huh?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:16.360
If you need anything further, please contact the attendant

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.190
provided by Her Highness
Princess Veronica.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:20.320
Princess Veronica?

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.090
In here.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.500
I-I'm so sorry!

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.040
Prim?

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.130
Why, you...

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.170
Prim!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.720
What is the meaning of this?

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:45.520
My clothes get really dirty while I clean,

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:46.970
so I work in my underwear.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.980
You're allowed to get
your maid uniform dirty!

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.720
I-I'm sorry!

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.350
Hey! Quit staring!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:54.980
I thought I was doing the right thing!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.490
Why do you have so many of these?

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:11.000
I get my clothes dirty all the time,

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.250
so I carry plenty of spares with me.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.730
I see.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.250
This is way too tight.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.130
How can you wear this?

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.850
Prim, please take care
of the two of them.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:22.730
Okay!

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:24.430
But cleaning comes first.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.420
R-Right!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.130
Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.890
Cleaning...

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.170
Butt...

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.190
O-Oh, of course.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.690
It'd be unpleasant to
wear wet underwear.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.360
Look!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.200
I'm not wearing any either!

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:53.200
I said quit staring!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:57.220
Prim...

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:59.320
Sorry!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.050
Silvia Lautreamont has returned.

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.290
How long I've waited for you,

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.970
my darling daughter!

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:17.690
This old familiar pain...

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.450
The bite of your fist...

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:24.980
How closely you resemble
your late mother Elizabeth!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.840
How irritating.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:30.330
And you sound just like her too!

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.870
You should be ashamed, getting off on your daughter scolding you!

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:38.120
Now, where were we?

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:44.480
Father, to what do I owe the pleasure of my invitation to the Congress?

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.610
I am a mere student, still in training.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.430
You're the fourth princess and a Dragonar.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.180
You're quite qualified.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.200
I'm not the one who recommended you.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.180
That was Veronica.

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.730
My elder sister?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:03.790
She talks tough, but she
recognizes your skill.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:11.240
Then why bring Ash Blake and Eco here at such a busy time?

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.810
It is indeed a busy time for our nation.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:19.110
But as you know, I'm just a figurehead.

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:22.710
The more everyone buzzes around me,
the more free time I have!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:28.460
In other words, you wanted someone to kill time with.

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:33.170
And I've been hearing so many rumors about those two!

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.930
You're such a child.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.560
Thank you so much.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.560
Now, then.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.710
Let's check it out, okay?

00:07:56.520 --> 00:08:00.330
Well, if you insist, I suppose
I could go with you.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.080
Let's do it!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.990
Then allow me to lead the way!

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.850
Ugh! Let's hurry up and change so we can get out of here!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.340
Whoa, stop!

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:14.590
Father, there is one more matter about which I must inquire.

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.710
Why so stuffy?

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.950
It's about my brother Julius.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.940
Was he really executed?

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:27.360
Of course. What are you saying?

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:31.570
He was a dragonslayer who killed his Pal by his own hand.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:36.240
Such a crime is unforgivable,
even for a prince!

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.240
Yes, of course.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.220
Princess?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.600
<i>He's a terrible liar.</i>

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:07.690
Wow!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:14.260
This place really <i>is </i>nothing
at all like Ansullivan!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.360
Five hundred years ago,
King Lionel III of Chevron

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.580
named Durham the very first Paladin.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:28.580
This statue commemorates that ceremony.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:33.180
After that, Durham became independent of the Chevron Kingdom

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.690
and went on to establish
Lautreamont Knight Country.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.120
Oh, what's that?

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.680
Hey, reel it in, would you?

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:17.110
Sorry for running you
ragged today, Prim.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:25.390
Not at all. I apologize for
lacking the energy to keep up.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.520
Ash!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:30.020
Hurry up, or I'll pop ya one!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:35.030
I can't come all the way to the capital and not have crepes!

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.250
What kind of logic is that?

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:42.580
Got it! I'll have a chocolate mint and a cheese and raspberry!

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:55.930
Say... why are those people
so stuck on each other?

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:56.600
Huh?

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:00.430
And why are you staring
at them like you're jealous?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.830
W-Was I?

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.160
Like a starving dog.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.550
That hurts.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:09.940
So why are they all over
each other like that?

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:12.220
W-Well, uh...

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.440
probably because they're lovers.

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.440
Lovers?

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:23.730
Is that so...

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.590
You... can hold my hand if you want.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:42.090
Okay, if you say so.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:06.810
Hands only! Hands only!
That's as much as I'll allow!

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:07.790
I-I know!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.040
But do you? Do you really?!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.620
I do, really!

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:21.570
That's...

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.060
That crest...

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.760
It's the crest of the
House of Witershausen.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.890
He's attending the Continental Congress from the Zepharos Empire,

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.900
as a representative of the emperor.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.770
Cosette! Wh-Where'd you come from?!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.440
I'm here to pick you up.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.620
Banquet time! Time for meat!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.290
Guess I'm not used to these clothes.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:52.620
Banquet time! Time for meat!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.000
They just feel so stiff.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:54.520
Banquet time! Time for meat!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.880
Meat, meat, meat!

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.050
Don't make a scene, okay?

00:12:58.050 --> 00:13:00.310
If we offend the head of state...

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:01.800
I'll be good.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.290
I've gotta make it through
the very last dessert!

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.170
What is it, Ash?

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:26.950
Uh...

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.830
It's just... I was just thinking
how beautiful you are.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:35.580
Now you listen here...

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:39.560
You didn't say a thing about my dress!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.090
Y-You're beautiful too, Eco!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:45.590
Like a forced compliment is
going to make me happy!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.790
You little shit!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.100
The preparations are complete.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.260
Huh? Commando girl!

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:54.240
Hey!

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.410
Follow me, please.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.690
Ah, so you're Ash!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.360
What a pleasant face you have!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.770
And you must be Eco.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:09.290
Just look at those horns!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.870
Thank you both for
coming all this way.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.710
Please relax and enjoy yourselves.

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.820
And we were so nervous
about meeting the Paladin.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:21.500
I like him! This dude is
super easy to talk to!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.380
Eco!

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:28.830
Let me thank you again for handling that Necromancia incident

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.890
and the Willingham Mausoleum affair.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.890
P-Please don't bow to me!

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.060
And so, Ash,

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.940
from this day on, you are a Dragonar.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.530
Y-Yes, sir.

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:40.900
Huh?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.190
What?!

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:45.440
That's why I called you here.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:53.360
But, uh... isn't that title given to
Maestro riders, like the princess?

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.920
Eco is a special dragon
in the shape of a human.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:15:00.460
It would be odd to measure her and
regular dragons by the same yardstick.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:05.290
Besides, given the splendid showing she's made so far,

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:07.950
can you swear she's not a Maestro?

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:08.970
Well...

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:14.220
And so I, as Paladin, have decided that you are a Dragonar from today on.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.880
Frieda, if you would.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.230
Certainly.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:26.980
In the name of Paladin Oswald, Ash Blake...

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.430
is hereby appointed Dragonar.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.420
I humbly accept.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.450
<i>Ash, a Dragonar?</i>

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:48.120
<i>If he goes on to
become an Archdragonar,</i>

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:51.050
<i>he'll have the same standing as nobility.</i>

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:54.360
<i>That means he can marry royalty.</i>

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:57.010
<i>M-Marry?!</i>

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:00.010
Your face is awfully red, Princess.

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.890
I-It's nothing!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:08.400
So, Father,

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:14.410
I heard the emperor of Zepharos
won't be attending this Congress.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:18.780
He declined, citing his advanced age.

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:22.410
And they have sent a mere
noble in his place?

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:24.490
They had no choice.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:26.670
No one is immune
to the ravages of time.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.670
You're too trusting, Father.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.650
First we talk.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.760
We must not cause another war.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:38.510
That's why tomorrow's
masquerade ball is so important.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.180
A masquerade ball?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:44.060
Attendees cover their faces
with masks and speak freely,

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.750
with no thought given
to country or delegation.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:49.440
Say, would you two like to go?

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.130
Us?

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.950
I know I'm going.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:54.950
What about you, Eco?

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:57.070
If they have meat, I'm there.

00:16:57.350 --> 00:16:58.960
Then it's settled!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.830
Make the most of your evening at tomorrow's masquerade ball!

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.800
Y-Yes, sir.

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.700
By the way, Ash...

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:06.330
Yes?

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.590
There's just one thing
I have to ask.

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:13.590
Wh-What might that be?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:17.340
You're not in an impure relationship with Silvia, are you?

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.300
Huh?!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.350
Father! What are you—

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:26.520
Ash, if you ever lay a finger
on my darling Silvia...

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:34.320
I, Oswald, shall punish you myself!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:38.300
Honest! There's nothing between the princess and me!

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:40.160
C'mon, Your Highness, tell him!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:00.180
Master Milgauss!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.300
You're looking well, I see.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.570
Not bad.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:18.070
Looks like you didn't know
about Milgauss's arm.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:21.940
Mahogany, the color of maturity.

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:25.240
Perfect for me now,
at this particular juncture.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:29.830
Are you that Tantalos girl
he's got working for him?

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:33.550
Y-Yes. I'm Anya.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.800
I am Klaus Witershausen.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:41.760
<i>Klaus... Military nobility
from the Zepharos Empire.</i>

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:45.270
This is ten years ago now.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:50.990
A young man wandered
throughout my country,

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:54.900
having lost his name, his rank, his
reputation, and finally, his left arm.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:19:01.780
He carried a curse, having committed a taboo in his homeland.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.350
You talk too much, Klaus.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:08.650
Whoops, a gag order.

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.140
Too bad.

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.700
Do you know what this is?

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:32.310
A magica-technica device?

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:35.290
Well, aren't you an observant girl.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:40.300
I call this magic device Yggdrasil.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:42.420
Who cares what it's called?

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:44.740
The question is, can we use it?

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.200
We can start testing it tomorrow.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:53.210
All we need is a test subject.

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.310
A subject?

00:19:56.020 --> 00:20:00.970
This device will force the
young dragon Eco to awaken.

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:03.220
It was Milgauss's idea.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.200
You mean... in there?

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:11.000
So your duty is?

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.120
To capture Eco.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.810
Correct.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.320
What a splendid little
underling you have, Milgauss.

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:28.580
<i>Is this a dream?</i>

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:44.470
<i>How did I fail to notice?</i>

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.970
<i>That face, that build...</i>

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:51.640
<i>That was none other than
my brother's Pal, Mordred.</i>

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:58.030
Silvia?

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:03.160
My sister! And Glen...
and even Avdocha?

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:04.530
What do you mean, "even"?!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:07.580
Are you saying you don't
want me around you?

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:10.650
It seems I'll have to lay bare
those udders of yours again!

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:11.410
Ow!

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:15.840
Since when have you ranked high enough to insult my sister?

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:18.420
I-I won't get taller if you keep doing that!

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:23.170
The very idea that you'd grow another inch past the age of twenty is absurd.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.990
I heard that!

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:27.470
What business do you have here so early in the morning?

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:31.060
Oh, just something on my mind.

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:33.430
Mordred's ashes?

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.090
You too?

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:39.660
Yes. After the Willingham incident,

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:43.020
I investigated all of the
dragon mausoleums.

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:43.940
And?

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:49.500
As expected, someone had removed dragon ashes from every mausoleum in the country.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:53.080
Mordred's ashes, interred here,
were no exception.

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:55.330
I knew it.

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:59.880
Did this Mordred thing
ring any bells for you?

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:03.050
This man I saw at the Willingham Mausoleum the other day,

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:05.230
calling himself Milgauss...

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:07.130
We know of him.

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:09.840
This is just a hunch,

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:13.770
but I think that man might
actually be our older brother.

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:15.920
Impossible!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:19.850
H-He survived and became
an Imperial army spy?!

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:22.270
It's just not possible!

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.140
There's more.

00:22:25.590 --> 00:22:30.410
I sensed Mordred among the
Necromancia that attacked Ansullivan.

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:33.910
Silvia...

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:37.080
Don't talk to anyone else about this.

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:43.800
The Lautreamont name stands to be deeply wounded just because Julius is alive.

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:46.630
I won't, sister.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.430
How beautiful it is.

00:22:55.430 --> 00:23:00.940
Yggdrasil is complete. With this, the dragonkind's power will be ours.

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:03.880
Soon the Imperial throne
will be a dream no longer.

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:11.130
Can you feel the intensity?

00:24:50.240 --> 00:24:51.130
I'll have to show you a thing or two.

00:24:51.130 --> 00:24:54.050
Wait, how exactly did you mean that? Hey!
